32474632", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_29271109649141297_7977265845579411909_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ejeuQfGLMEQ7kNvwEKGh-k&_nc_oc=AdrXQ1cBpd0JS871tdvU_fkBgCXDyV9EWNrznqdiBfBjf9fNyhd3nVuzKJADVl7GyhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTeqqIvWc9y1BfZ4y7Ir-e0-MLl3CSO6Er6hJ5K1GH6KA&oe=6B0B0E5E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1088797830417962", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1088797837084628_2030138725379435615_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=64woLnFzw7kQ7kNvwG_qODI&_nc_oc=AdqAivSjfJ672--irKh963KK1zi-r22D8Y7ad8gzHAHKBwEAyXgnEmdTJ9ATeeCzqAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS2TxxHuRY_ye2qHWbmFYVtRyyuMFJWSiWufm0UzrIc9Q&oe=6B0B1E36"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "YadKon VR", "keywords": ["iran", "memorial", "politics"], "long_description": "YadKon VR is the interactive memorial space designed for standalone Meta Quest headsets. Created as an extension of the YadKon registry, this application provides a tranquil environment for visitors around the world to pay tribute, light candles, and preserve the memory of individuals lost during human rights events in Iran.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- **Interactive Memorial Hall**: Walk through a serene, high-fidelity 3D environment dedicated to reflection and honor.\n- **Flower tributes**: Plant flowers in the memorial space of each individual.\n- **Standalone VR Experience**: Runs natively on Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S, and Pro without needing a tethered PC.\n- **6DOF Positional Motion**: Full room-scale navigation with intuitive Touch Controller interactions.\n\nPurpose & Mission:\n\nYadKon serves as a digital monument and historical archive. It offers a respectful, quiet space for family members, international supporters, and human rights advocates to co